desc.barrend_bogs_7=__UNTRANSLATED__guests. Tampering too much
desc.barrend_bogs_8=__UNTRANSLATED__may result in a quick fate.
desc.barrend_bogs_9=__UNTRANSLATED__This biome seems to hold a
desc.barrend_bogs_10=__UNTRANSLATED__older culture and civilization
desc.barrend_bogs_11=__UNTRANSLATED__going back before the war
desc.barrend_bogs_12=__UNTRANSLATED__between the Fell Knights
desc.barrend_bogs_13=__UNTRANSLATED__and the End's resistance.
